  "name": "rudevolution",
  "summary": "Statically analyze JavaScript bundles into weighted reference graphs. Propose module boundaries and identifier names with confidence metadata. Boundaries: Nested packages and scoped instructions are not exhaustively inventoried. Module/name recovery is heuristic and may change behavior. Integrity witnesses do not establish authorship, original intent or behavioral equivalence. Clean-room workflow is a developer preview.",
